Check system privileges granted to a user (DBA_SYS_PRIVS):
SELECT * FROM  WHERE GRANTEE = 'AGREEMENT_REPO';

Check object-level privileges(ALL_TAB_PRIVS,DBA_TAB_PRIVS,USER_TAB_PRIVS):
SELECT * FROM USER_TAB_PRIVS WHERE GRANTEE = 'AGREEMENT_REPO';

Check roles granted to a user:
SELECT * FROM DBA_ROLE_PRIVS WHERE GRANTEE = 'AGREEMENT_REPO';

Check privileges granted through roles:
SELECT * FROM ROLE_SYS_PRIVS WHERE ROLE IN (SELECT GRANTED_ROLE FROM DBA_ROLE_PRIVS WHERE GRANTEE = 'AGREEMENT_REPO');
